#: scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52b4c69616d1b7c98c14cea636ac2fbc2df73407b920651fc249617bebd51396
#. default-sha256: f3564630919754a6062efc58c4d85a2150de1e6335d5dd686548a5afa6e7e6e5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Several days passed by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫わたくしと、⟪k:8⟫ベステアの日々はそれからまた少し、⟪k:9⟫過"
"ぎていきました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b390e660bd7eb6ecf5df4a476fe3d73b1487727b952bfe9f9a011577b9ed35a4
#. default-sha256: 8fd1acf68595b9bb89c78d968bb8e0a52b8c4b1c3914ebe38806da96cd278a3f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As Bestia began to act more like a person, the mansion followed suit, slowly becoming more "
"habitable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not yet back to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人らしさをベステアが覚えていくと、⟪k:1⟫徐々にお屋敷も、⟪k:2⟫かつての栄光とまでは行きません"
"が……⟪k:3⟫人の住む環境へと戻っていきました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fff65ddad65a3f467060f48b05ecf00a5ea31a1473a0c5a81e9980e89e2fee23
#. default-sha256: f94facbbbe1d3185da7e29b213d682ad9c4a9b36b0b0b54e5286d5bb0e946ddf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No flowers grew in the garden, but neither were there weeds infesting it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お庭はやはり花の一本も見当たりませんけど、⟪k:1⟫雑草だらけではなくなりましたし、"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ccf7f4b864ab21732d9cc37fa5e01ef54bb503444f4ad8260bcd8c615baba44
#. default-sha256: 07b30999ac0c38ac131f7947aa98155bffb88f4f4cb04a4d6ffac51eab40c9a3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The dusty corridors, shattered windows, rust-covered kitchen gradually returned to their "
"proper states."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫埃だらけの廊下も割れてしまった窓も、⟪k:1⟫錆ついたキッチンも、⟪k:2⟫少しずつ少しずつ元に戻りま"
"した。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2721f962ece34606ba007411ef3620ab8996948012d93422ff4e784c3ee2c9d4
#. default-sha256: dc9ce8705375693733fd4c679c81743296dd53c6bef3d104cd40cd3513ac33a2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia learned how to change his own clothes, and how to draw a bath."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼は着替えを覚えましたし、⟪k:1⟫湯を張ることも覚えました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b99c1e72da59c612685e68cbb5b78a47da0189c502c16f570458c379eba2c0ab
#. default-sha256: 0232c589610d975c2bb10ac472f2a840bf0e5ee946c918a26927792b4e67f307
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer did I have to wait on him hand and foot; he could take care of a number of things "
"all by himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしが手取り足取りお世話をしなくとも、⟪k:1⟫ひとりで様々なことが出来るようになりましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b52a896311f559ca7b262c43b6c2d5a110033da20afca09ecb04e9dd02d29fbb
#. default-sha256: ee58a4325c74760512f3a832c720c81642a790d2ae5743a1685695589391e777
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What we lacked for food, he acquired from the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫足りない食料は、⟪k:1⟫彼が森から捕ってきました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a9aa6a8b15593d5d0833d2a57a5ebf1248735c9195b6c8afacce3c5c035cb7d
#. default-sha256: 050e0b33aadb5cbbcb96609b2dda629e71607f9084d5b598dc1a317d1b919171
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Never did he go to purchase supplies from the village; rather, he captured hares and "
"gathered herbs hidden in the overgrowth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫決して買い出しのために村や町には行かず、⟪k:1⟫草の隙間から顔をのぞかせる野兎や、⟪k:2⟫雑草の隙"
"間に生える山菜などを、⟪k:3⟫見繕ってくるのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9d4a3534b173000523c49e5939907a2c6b914d51375fb38d2cad6ccf8aa0a9d
#. default-sha256: 40c3bf6da4e4b16fb105e2c8dfcdeea454134e5fe75918081fe5cfba3ec65965
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were days without incident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何も無い日々でした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f886bf7193c39b018bfe7ea1d83e5c3c63277d374d2e153be958d1da06f566b
#. default-sha256: c0d05ae50877ba4152d28fc47d5741286d21f8e9236357a1e1cb2b195cf24388
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And though such a life may be want for excitement,⟪k:1⟫peace is something that you mustn’t "
"take for granted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何も無いこと……、⟪k:1⟫けれどそれは、⟪k:2⟫得難い平穏なのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d706f7973d9221071ffcc6bd9f49483df29dbff92b3254e22c4fe990ab5878b
#. default-sha256: bf1cd713ceae6ecf21c95fbb1a3e3636edc4ba3cad3bc4f015d3bac61f422bf4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those who have it cast it aside, finding the leisurely flow of time dull.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Only "
"those who have never experienced it truly know how precious it is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫手にした者はただ退屈と切り捨ててしまう、⟪k:1⟫ゆっくりとした時間。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫手にしたことが無い"
"者だけ、⟪k:4⟫価値の分かるもの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca01f8db2b224a251462bcca64171f32a28accdaef0e63db8c06c3a870828574
#. default-sha256: 84e587cb1818469a389f7a70a682c3e8c98d8a643d581790bbc9b531dbec15e2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia appeared to be content.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He wore an expression of solitary serenity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ベステアは、⟪k:1⟫満足そうに見えました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼の横顔は寂しそうな幸福に満ちていたのですか"
"ら。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdc1b42d72f1274964e4aed69c9653e766004b4570cb8d9a66cd12aad035cb4a
#. default-sha256: 6810f85153268374f3b717582c011d384a1d59e19fb78ac23eb261074a5fc031
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is anyone there?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t誰か……、⟪k:2⟫誰か、⟪k:3⟫いないか！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecc5d1161c43ae8bb7d946d676a2453e5e2cd1d221283b8bce3a699529f42c3d
#. default-sha256: abed04d078a1d599fc8e6dfa24a9532498dc69644f350078ab454b061cb88576
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, a crack formed in the uneventful tranquility."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t何も無い平穏に、⟪k:1⟫亀裂が入ったのはその日でございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4466d11355806119b28607834dfbb7b9b1f3f63076360fcef5438bf22bc84038
#. default-sha256: 891bd63c0e7baf3628126170665d75e9fad2d2c3257c63617cbbbd7c9651c83a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Is anyone... ⟪k:1⟫in there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you part with some food?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t need "
"much..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t誰か……いないのか。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫少しでいいんだ、⟪k:3⟫食べ物を分け"
"与えてくれないか……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19c44aff7296afa88716189b5bdf78993e7b6b1d62b95cd92d5468f23d7e88f6
#. default-sha256: b3ad82670f3fa5b032aecf15e73aefdd6bcdaf73eafaef81aefef7c3615363b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t…………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b7d4e6e47269f1cbdc976693edf897e08ca1415c471ff55cf4fbeb5605bf11f
#. default-sha256: b20a57ab23ea09aebdd51e5b57744866edda575f94f82163aedf5e05ecbb1569
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Some food and water...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just a little... ⟪k:4⟫that’s all I need."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t少しでいい……、⟪k:2⟫少しでいいから、⟪k:3⟫水と、⟪k:4⟫食料"
"を……。\t"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 720469f12669e7c8c224cfe5587bc831e00fcfc04b4b55a5df05e7a13b782482
#. default-sha256: cde18f4082b87ef7e0a93ee0835846490823696a237146073418a40bfff3576b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia looked over at me, as if seeking my aid."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tベステアは、⟪k:1⟫わたくしに救いを求めるような目をしておりまし"
"た。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d4bd655dde3e512935759465f1fd91d62f6919bee596d76dd7cfc573bb0906e
#. default-sha256: 5474caa20b8b676cdee4e9528f3fbefef2239e1630c9806a6389b2340020cbad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ironic, no? It was the visitor who was truly in need of aid."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tおかしな話ではありませんか？　⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫救いを求めているのは"
"来訪者だというのに。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7555c87f45e0e27be50a193e616be919b09a3a595dc566f878577ac877bc2722
#. default-sha256: 6d2611e500e9b70d351cae1595c6ea9f45e106e01f5334b2fdb88a42055a9d63
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I pondered it for a few moments, deciding that I could not simply turn away someone calling "
"upon the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tわたくしは少しばかり悩みましたが、⟪k:1⟫お屋敷に訪れる者を無碍"
"に帰すわけにはいきません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e5ff6f6049b8f201ac9ab81028848834c6d6604c04a354a48592adef884c8b5
#. default-sha256: a89394d84cf777d28f8f8865990a5a94cfb6a3fac525a2c95140297599cc6183
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Bestia ordered me to not let him in, I would have followed his instructions, but he said "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tもしベステアが招き入れるなと言ったなら、⟪k:1⟫そう従ったでしょ"
"うけど、⟪k:2⟫彼は言いませんでしたから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29f3e852c194a01c8769caa54a45c54261842e05a15a6c1d7129277b89a563b1
#. default-sha256: 174d10a833bdcdfb6f6c8c32b6c55b768e48cfd196c8dbc997597480f2bce4f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, thank God... ⟪k:9⟫someone’s here.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I "
"was afraid it was deserted..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tああ、⟪k:9⟫"
"良かった……⟪k:10⟫人がいた。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫てっきり無人なのかと……。\t"

#: scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4f26f0584b32d083af66ad973f4421e254254845d2ce3b86a320e2364b0c8fe
#. default-sha256: 8d9ab06072f123aaf111a17e300c401158eac11f515951c5ad64093452ef4347
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said you were in need of sustenance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫食べ物が欲しいんでしたわね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aab8d31b0e3e59bb1a86605f6f8f424350b465b81a5e7b014c457c0887f7a3a0
#. default-sha256: 6de14e01c0e9af3c496b3c956572aa9894b255237a3050fb8e75c8cedb706e2f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It doesn’t have to be much.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything to quench this thirst..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tえ、⟪k:1⟫ええ……。⟪k:2⟫"
